      <h1 class="ed-title">How to Clean a Treadmill</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        Cleaning a treadmill is mostly about sweat and dust, and mostly about restraint: a damp cloth, mild soap and a dry finish handle nearly everything. The damage comes from spraying liquids into electronics and from cleaners that leave the belt slippery.
      </p>

      <!-- Byline -->
      <div class="ed-byline">
        <img src="/authors/shaheer-ali-khan.png" alt="Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD" width="44" height="44" />
        <div class="ed-byline-text">
